flowchart TD
    A[Admin opens Quiz tab] --> B[Click Create Quiz]
    B --> C[Step 1: Basic Info - title, description]
    C --> D{Title entered?}
    D -- No --> C
    D -- Yes --> E[Step 2: Content - download template, upload JSON]
    E --> F{JSON valid and non-empty?}
    F -- No --> G[Inline error: malformed/empty/oversized file]
    G --> E
    F -- Yes --> H[Show upload success + question count]
    H --> I[Admin reviews questions in accordion]
    I --> J[Step 3: Publish - set default passing score + retake toggle]
    J --> K[Click Publish Quiz]
    K --> L[Publishing quiz... state]
    L --> M[Success toast - quiz is now live]
    M --> N[Quiz appears in Quiz tab, status Published]

    N --> O[Admin clicks Assign on quiz row]
    O --> P[Assign Step 1: Assignment Type - single unit]
    P --> Q[Assign Step 2: Assessment - confirm/override passing score + retake]
    Q --> R[Assign Step 3: Assign To - Users/Departments/Custom Groups/Smart Groups]
    R --> S[Assign Step 4: Review]
    S --> T[Click Assign Quiz]
    T --> U[Live assignment progress X/Y]
    U --> V{Any per-user failures?}
    V -- Yes --> W[Results: success count + failure table, e.g. already assigned]
    V -- No --> X[Results: assigned successfully to N users]

    W --> Y[Learner sees Quiz card on dashboard]
    X --> Y
    Y --> Z[Learner clicks Start Quiz]
    Z --> AA[Question N of M, Attempt X/3, single-select MCQ]
    AA --> AB[Click Next]
    AB --> AC{More questions?}
    AC -- Yes --> AA
    AC -- No --> AD[Score evaluated against assignment passing score]
    AD --> AE{Score >= passing score?}
    AE -- Yes --> AF[Passed - marked Completed]
    AE -- No --> AG{Retake on fail enabled AND attempts < 3?}
    AG -- Yes --> AH[Failed - Retake Quiz action]
    AH --> AA
    AG -- No --> AI[Terminal: Failed - Attempts exhausted]

    AF --> AJ[Admin opens user's Training Status row]
    AI --> AJ
    AJ --> AK[Drill-down: Overall Score, Date Completed, Attempts used, per-question breakdown]
    AK --> AL[Admin filters Quiz name / Quiz Status in Advanced Reporting]
